### Feature Product — CREATE
### Modalidad JWT + RBAC. Recurso `POST /api/products`: solo lo concede ADMIN (SELLER no).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Login SELLER
# @name loginSeller
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "seller",
  "password": "Seller123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}
@sellerToken = {{loginSeller.response.body.$.access_token}}

### CREATE — admin -> 201
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "PROD-001",
  "name": "Hamburguesa clásica",
  "description": "Hamburguesa con tomate",
  "price": 12500,
  "status": "active"
}

### 403 — el SELLER NO tiene concedido `POST /api/products` (deny by default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "PROD-RBAC",
  "name": "Prueba RBAC",
  "price": 12500
}

### 401 — sin token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "PROD-SIN-TOKEN",
  "name": "Sin token",
  "price": 12500
}
